supporter-loadout-required = Requires an active Respected Member of Society subscription and Discord linking via supporterlink.
supporter-not-configured = Automatic subscription checks have not been configured by the server owner yet.
supporter-link-code = Send this to the server bot in a direct message: { $command }. Valid for 10 minutes; do not share this code.
supporter-invalid-code = Invalid or expired code. Generate a new one with supporterlink in game and stay connected.
supporter-link-conflict = One of these accounts is already linked to another account. Contact administration to change the link.
supporter-linked = Accounts linked. Subscription verification starts automatically. Check supporterstatus in game. Reopen loadout selection if it is already open.
supporter-link-failed = Could not complete linking. Try again later or contact administration.
supporter-checking = Checking your subscription. Run supporterstatus again in a few seconds.
supporter-not-linked = Discord is not linked. Run supporterlink in the game console.
supporter-active = Subscription active: supporter loadouts are available. The store is issued when spawning in an eligible job for the current round.
supporter-inactive = Discord linked, but the supporter role is not confirmed. Check your subscription, Boosty's Discord link and server membership. Access updates when the role is granted or removed.
supporter-command-link = Get a code to link your game account to Discord.
supporter-command-status = Check your supporter subscription status.
supporter-command-unlink = Remove a game account's Discord link.
supporter-unlinked = Account unlinked.
supporter-link-window-title = Link Discord
supporter-link-window-instructions = Copy the command and send it to the game bot in a direct message.
supporter-link-window-expiry = The code lasts 10 minutes. Keep it private and stay connected to the game.
supporter-link-copy = Copy command
supporter-link-copied = Copied
